# Build context exclusions for the SIGNER image.
#
# The signer receives its Turnkey credentials as environment variables at
# RUNTIME (docker-compose's `env_file: ./signer_service/.env`). They must
# never be COPYed into the image: an image layer is permanent, gets pushed
# to any registry the image goes to, and survives deleting the file.
.env
*.env
!.env.example
*credentials*.json
*.pem
*.key

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
